      "blurb": "Executes your program, sampling analog voltage on A0 with a 10-bit ADC and driving digital pin D8 between 0 V and 5 V. Because its GPIO stage has about 25 ohms of source resistance and limited current capacity, it switches the LED through Q1 rather than driving the load directly."
